Package: agristat
Title: Comprehensive Biostatistical Suite for Agricultural and Genetic Research
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Lungan", "Lungpg", , "lunganlungpg@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive suite of biostatistical tools for agricultural and
    genetic research. Provides functions for experimental design, data ingestion,
    mean separation tests (DMRT, Tukey HSD, Dunnett), orthogonal contrasts,
    genetic analysis (AMMI, heritability, GWAS), and publication-ready
    visualization.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
