    stats,
    ggplot2,
    multcomp,
    rlang,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    agricolae
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/lunganlungpg/agristat
